881	     * The fixed list of public holidays that are not business days. A registration date that lands
882	     * on one of these is rolled forward by {@link #businessDay(LocalDate)} to the next non-holiday
883	     * business day, exactly as it is rolled forward off a weekend.
884	     */
885	    private static final Set<LocalDate> PUBLIC_HOLIDAYS = Set.of(
886	        LocalDate.of(2026, 1, 1),
887	        LocalDate.of(2026, 1, 26),
888	        LocalDate.of(2026, 4, 25),
889	        LocalDate.of(2026, 12, 25),
890	        LocalDate.of(2026, 12, 28));
