1173	    /**
1174	     * The existing owners that make up the given owner's household: those sharing its
1175	     * {@code householdId} (see {@link #householdId(Owner)}). An owner with no {@code householdId}
1176	     * (e.g. no postcode) belongs to no shared household, so the result is empty. Whether the owner
1177	     * itself appears depends on when the scan runs relative to the create's save: a scan taken after
1178	     * the owner is persisted (as the {@link #householdSize(Owner) household size} derivation is)
1179	     * counts it among its household, while one taken before the save sees only the owners already
1180	     * present. Holding the household lookup in one place lets every household-derived value read the
1181	     * same set of members.
1182	     *
1183	     * @param owner the owner whose household members are wanted
1184	     * @return the owners sharing the owner's household, or an empty list when it has no household
1185	     */
1186	    private List<Owner> householdMembers(Owner owner) {
1187	        String household = owner.getHouseholdId();
1188	        if (household == null) {
1189	            return List.of();
1190	        }
1191	        return this.clinicService.findAllOwners().stream()
1192	            .filter(existing -> household.equals(existing.getHouseholdId()))
1193	            .toList();
1194	    }
